PIPELINE EVIDENCE:

The research packet selected one on-topic source (The Register, score 100) and three off-topic sources with score 11 each, matched only on generic terms ("apple," "source"). The irrelevant sources â€” a Taco Bell food-safety story, a San Francisco nudify-app enforcement story, and an Apple versus Nvidia market-cap story â€” contributed nothing to the writing packet and should be understood as noise in the assignment's source selection, not as a deficiency in the sourcing layer. The single relevant source is adequate for the assignment. No prior production run is recorded.

